Teaching"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson planning"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"Digital pedagogy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary-source analysis"},{"text":"Archival research"},{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Citation"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Historiography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Digital archives"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital storytelling"},{"text":"AI research tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Critical thinking"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Debate"},{"text":"Mentoring"},{"text":"Academic presentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","School Teaching Route","Higher Education Route"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Teacher/Academic Educator"},{"text":"Research/Academic Assistant"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Teacher"},{"text":"Lecturer/Assistant Professor route"}],[{"text":"5–10 years"},{"text":"Subject Coordinator"},{"text":"Assistant Professor"}],[{"text":"8–15 years"},{"text":"Head of Department"},{"text":"Associate Professor"}],[{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Academic Leadership"},{"text":"Professor/HoD/Academic Leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an ideal candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BA History"},{"text":"Strong knowledge of Indian and world history"},{"text":"Strong academic writing"},{"text":"Understanding of historiography"},{"text":"Primary-source analysis skills"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"At least one teaching/research internship"},{"text":"Lesson-planning experience"},{"text":"Classroom presentation experience"},{"text":"Digital teaching capability"},{"text":"Basic QGIS/GIS knowledge"},{"text":"Digital archive experience"},{"text":"One substantial historical research project"},{"text":"Strong source-verification habits"},{"text":"AI literacy for education and research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"BA History + strong historical knowledge + research methodology + primary-source analysis + teaching experience + lesson planning + communication + digital pedagogy + QGIS/digital archives + AI/source-verification skills → History Teacher → Senior Teacher/Subject Coordinator → Head of History/Humanities; or MA History → eligible higher-education route → Assistant Professor/Lecturer → Associate Professor → Professor/Academic Leadership."},{"type":"h","text":"1398 | BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours) | History | Archaeologist (after PG)"}]}]}